# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "l-app-grid-stagger"
verdict good
note "First reference (eval-finish): read k1-33: on the panel's first frame every tile shows its pose (opacity 0, scale 0.85); Files starts at k2 and each later tile is let go 25 ms after the one before (k3, k5, k6, k8, k9, k11, k12), held hidden at 0.85 until then, each springing to 1 with a 0.4% overshoot; closing takes the panel at once, and the quick reopen on a new surface replays the same turns until it closes at k33."
